{
  "name": "dsh-plugin-dev-kb",
  "description": "dsh 插件辅助：① dsh-plugin-dev-kb 技能 = DeepSeek Harness 官方文档站完整 Markdown 镜像（中英双语 192 页）+ 439 篇仓库补充开发参考 + 主题导航与 634 文件全量搜索索引；② dsh-dev-sandbox 技能 = 自建独立沙箱 profile 开发沙箱工作流（沙箱名由 agent 按任务自定），开发中的插件隔离运行，agent 自主启动/重启/冒烟验证，插件崩了不影响主力 dsh；③ dsh_kb_search 工具 = 知识库本地打分检索，一次调用返回命中文件 + 行号 + 上下文片段。零运行时依赖。",
  "version": "1.6.0",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "docs",
    "kb",
    "skills",
    "scripts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "selfcheck": "node scripts/selfcheck.mjs",
    "rebuild-index": "node scripts/rebuild-index.mjs"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek",
    "harness",
    "cordis",
    "plugin",
    "knowledge",
    "knowledge-base",
    "documentation",
